package com.astro.prediction;

import java.util.Map;

public final class LagnaTexts {
    private LagnaTexts() {}

    public static String getLagna(String sign) {
        return LAGNA.getOrDefault(sign, "With " + sign + " rising, your chart carries the qualities of this sign as its fundamental orientation toward life.");
    }

    public static String getHouseMeaning(int house) {
        return HOUSE_MEANING.getOrDefault(house, "The " + house + "th house governs its traditional domains of life.");
    }

    static final Map<String, String> LAGNA = Map.ofEntries(
        Map.entry("Aries", "With Aries rising, Mars governs your entire chart, stamping it with bold, direct, action-first energy. Your constitution tends toward a strong, athletic frame and a keen, assertive expression that people notice immediately. You approach life like a warrior approaches a campaign — with courage, momentum, and the full expectation of success. You initiate effortlessly, inspire others through decisiveness, and rarely let obstacles slow your stride for long. The shadow is impatience and acting before consequences are considered. Career paths favoring initiative — entrepreneurship, athletics, surgery, emergency medicine, engineering — are natural homes. Relationship-wise, you love passionately and need a partner who can match your independence. Health focus: head, blood, and adrenal system. Consistent physical exercise is not optional for your well-being — it is metabolically essential."),
        Map.entry("Taurus", "With Taurus rising, Venus governs your chart, weaving beauty, patience, and material intelligence through every domain. You carry a pleasant, often physically beautiful appearance and an inherent grace that draws people toward you. You are the zodiac's builder: methodical, determined, and unmoved by pressure to rush. Where others panic at slow progress, you understand that wealth, mastery, and love all require steady tending. Sensory appreciation — fine food, art, music, and physical comfort — is a genuine life philosophy. The challenge is the famous stubborn attachment: releasing what no longer serves, both materially and emotionally, is your lifelong curriculum. Finance, real estate, arts, and hospitality are natural domains. In love, you are deeply loyal but possessiveness requires conscious management. Health focus: throat, neck, thyroid, and vocal cords."),
        Map.entry("Gemini", "With Gemini rising, Mercury governs your chart and bestows an exceptionally active, curious, and versatile mind as your primary lens on life. Your build tends toward slender and youthful, with quick expressive eyes that signal your racing thoughts. You are the natural communicator — most alive in the exchange of ideas. Two distinct sides of your personality — logical and emotional, disciplined and scattered — coexist and require integration. Short attention, difficulty finishing what you begin, and nervous exhaustion from mental overwork are genuine vulnerabilities. Careers in media, education, writing, IT, and trade suit your agility. Relationships require mental stimulation — intellectual engagement matters as much as emotional connection. Health focus: lungs, arms, shoulders, and nervous system. Grounding practices are essential."),
        Map.entry("Cancer", "With Cancer rising, the Moon governs your chart, making your emotional life the gravitational center around which everything else orbits. Your round, soft-featured face and deeply empathetic eyes communicate immediate trustworthiness. Memory is exceptional — you recall feelings, conversations, and events with vivid precision, which makes you a gifted historian and sometimes a prisoner of the past. Home and family are your psychological headquarters; when harmonious, you function at peak level; when disturbed, all other areas suffer noticeably. You lead through nurturing rather than force — a deeply effective parent, mentor, and community anchor. Health focus: chest, stomach, and lymphatic system. Emotional stress most commonly appears as digestive disturbance. Mood management through creative and physical outlets is essential."),
        Map.entry("Leo", "With Leo rising, the Sun governs your chart, infusing your life with solar qualities — dignity, creative authority, and an unmistakable magnetic presence. Broad shoulders, upright posture, prominent bearing, and excellent hair are common physical signatures. You do not simply enter rooms; you fill them. Leadership is not chosen — it is what happens when you show up fully. Creative expression is a core life need; without it you diminish. Generosity is among your highest virtues. The shadow is pride: a need for recognition that, when unmet, hardens into wounded self-importance. You must learn that worth is intrinsic, not conditional on applause. Government, management, teaching, the arts — any field where you are center stage — suit your solar nature. Health focus: heart, circulatory system, and spine."),
        Map.entry("Virgo", "With Virgo rising, Mercury governs your chart through its earthy, analytical expression, making you one of the most intelligent, precision-oriented, and service-driven personalities in the zodiac. Slender and neat, with alert, precise quality to your movements, you notice what others miss: a misplaced detail, a structural flaw, a subtle inconsistency. This gift for discernment makes you an extraordinary analyst, healer, scientist, or craftsperson — but your inner critic never fully sleeps. Directing your discriminating intelligence outward toward problems rather than inward toward self-judgment is a central life lesson. Your relationship with service is deep — you derive genuine satisfaction from being genuinely useful. Medicine, accounting, editing, research, and nutrition are natural professional environments. Health focus: digestive system and intestinal health."),
        Map.entry("Libra", "With Libra rising, Venus governs your chart through its airy, relationship-oriented expression, making beauty, balance, justice, and partnership the organizing themes of your existence. Your appearance often carries classical Venusian grace — symmetrical, pleasant, and well-presented. You move through the world as a natural diplomat: hearing all sides, seeking common ground, maintaining charm under pressure. Injustice disturbs your equilibrium as viscerally as a discordant sound disturbs a musician. The Libran challenge is indecision — seeing every perspective's merit can paralyze commitment, and you may overweight others' preferences at expense of your own needs. Law, diplomacy, design, counseling, and the arts are natural homes. Partnership is central to your functioning. Health focus: kidneys, lower back, and hormonal balance."),
        Map.entry("Scorpio", "With Scorpio rising, Mars governs your chart through its deep, hidden, watery expression — making intensity, psychological penetration, and regenerative power your defining qualities. Your physical presence carries a magnetic, often mysterious quality: penetrating eyes that seem to look through people, and an air of controlled power that others sense without always being able to name. You possess extraordinary capacity to survive what would destroy others; crises do not pass through your life, they initiate you. You understand power, hidden motives, and the unconscious with an accuracy that unnerves those who prefer comfortable surfaces. Research, surgery, psychology, occult sciences, finance, and investigation are natural domains. In love, you are deeply passionate and capable of ferocious loyalty. Health focus: reproductive organs, colon, and immune function."),
        Map.entry("Sagittarius", "With Sagittarius rising, Jupiter governs your chart, blessing you with an expansive, optimistic, philosophically grounded, and inherently fortunate orientation toward existence. Your frame tends toward tall and athletic, with an open, welcoming expression that puts people at ease immediately. You are the eternal student and natural teacher — always seeking, always sharing, always moving toward the next horizon. Travel, both physical and intellectual, is a necessity rather than a luxury. Routine and confinement drain your spirit; new cultures, philosophies, and experiences restore it completely. Honesty and moral principle matter enormously, sometimes to the point of bluntness others receive as tactlessness. Teaching, law, theology, international business, and athletics are natural career environments. Health focus: hips, thighs, and liver. Overindulgence is a recurring vulnerability."),
        Map.entry("Capricorn", "With Capricorn rising, Saturn governs your chart, shaping you into one of the zodiac's most disciplined, methodically ambitious, and ultimately successful personalities — though usually through sustained effort rather than early luck. Your appearance carries solidity and seriousness: structured features, deliberate movements, and quiet authority that often makes you seem older in youth and strikingly vital in maturity. You understand that meaningful achievement requires time and consistent investment. You are the mountain climber — patient, strategic, and seemingly unremarkable until suddenly you are at the summit. Business, government, finance, law, administration, and engineering suit your methodical mastery. In relationships, you may be emotionally reserved but your loyalty and practical devotion are extraordinary once trust is established. Health focus: skeleton, joints, knees, and teeth."),
        Map.entry("Aquarius", "With Aquarius rising, Saturn governs your chart through its detached, humanitarian, and intellectually independent expression. Something in your manner or presentation signals immediately that you do not simply follow the crowd. You are drawn to ideas, causes, and communities rather than purely individual advancement — your greatest satisfaction comes from work that benefits many rather than just yourself. Intellectual freedom is non-negotiable: you require space to question, experiment, and arrive at your own conclusions. Technology, social reform, scientific research, humanitarian work, and innovation-driven fields are natural career domains. Your emotional style tends toward friendly warmth rather than deep passion — you may be perceived as detached even when genuinely devoted. Health focus: ankles, circulatory system, and nervous system."),
        Map.entry("Pisces", "With Pisces rising, Jupiter governs your chart through its oceanic, compassionate, and spiritually attuned expression. Your dreamy, approachable appearance and large expressive eyes communicate immediate understanding. You live simultaneously in the visible world and in a rich invisible world of feeling, intuition, and spiritual perception — this dual citizenship gives you extraordinary empathic range and artistic sensitivity. The challenge is clear boundary formation; without it you risk becoming depleted by others' needs or lost in escapist tendencies. Healing arts, music, film, poetry, psychology, spiritual counseling, and charitable service are natural professional environments. In love, you are deeply romantic and selflessly devoted, but must choose partners who honor rather than exploit your giving nature. Health focus: feet, lymphatic system, and immune function.")
    );

    static final Map<Integer, String> HOUSE_MEANING = Map.ofEntries(
        Map.entry(1, "The First House governs your physical self, overall constitution, appearance, personality as projected to the world, and the foundational quality of your entire life experience. Planets here color your entire identity and the lens through which you interpret all experience."),
        Map.entry(2, "The Second House governs accumulated wealth, family of origin, speech quality, values, early childhood, food preferences, and the resources you draw upon to build your life. It reveals how you earn and hold material resources and what you genuinely value."),
        Map.entry(3, "The Third House governs courage, younger siblings, short-distance travel, hands and arms, communication style, writing, and the daily mental effort you bring to life's immediate challenges. It reveals your relationship to effort, your social courage, and your communicative gifts."),
        Map.entry(4, "The Fourth House governs home, mother, emotional foundation, property and vehicles, the inner heart of happiness, and ancestral legacy. It reveals the quality of your private inner life and the stability — or instability — of your psychological foundations."),
        Map.entry(5, "The Fifth House governs intelligence, creativity, children, romance and courtship, past-life merit (purva punya), speculation, and the capacity for joy. It is the house of what you have earned through past righteous action and what your creative genius most naturally produces in this life."),
        Map.entry(6, "The Sixth House governs daily work, service, health challenges, enemies and competitors, debt, litigation, and the capacity to overcome obstacles. Strong planets here confer competitive prowess and the ability to triumph in difficult situations through sustained discipline."),
        Map.entry(7, "The Seventh House governs marriage, life partnerships, business partners, contracts, open enemies, and your orientation toward the significant other in any context. It reveals what you seek in partnership, what you project onto others, and the quality of your most intimate commitments."),
        Map.entry(8, "The Eighth House governs longevity, transformation, the occult and hidden knowledge, inheritance and shared resources, deep psychological change, and the experience of crisis as initiation. Planets here operate in the domain of radical change, uncovering, and regeneration."),
        Map.entry(9, "The Ninth House governs fortune, father, dharma, higher education, philosophy, religion, long-distance travel, teacher-student relationships, and the grace that flows when you are aligned with your deepest purpose. It is the house of divine favor and the accumulated good karma of past lives."),
        Map.entry(10, "The Tenth House governs career, social status, achievements, government, authority, and how you are seen and remembered by the world at large. Planets here significantly shape the nature and visibility of your professional contribution and the legacy you build through sustained action."),
        Map.entry(11, "The Eleventh House governs income, fulfillment of desires, older siblings, friends and social networks, gains from career, and the realization of long-term aspirations. It is the house of results — what your sustained efforts and relationships ultimately produce in terms of abundance and connection."),
        Map.entry(12, "The Twelfth House governs expenditure, isolation, foreign lands and foreign connection, liberation (moksha), hospital and ashram stays, the dissolution of ego, and the realms beyond ordinary waking consciousness. Planets here operate in the domain of surrender, transcendence, and spiritual completion.")
    );
}
